00:08:24.162 --> 00:08:26.968
AND LET’S PRAY THEY DON’T GET

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:27.756
WHAT THEY WANT.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.240
TRIBAL CONFLICT WILL DESTROY A

00:08:30.275 --> 00:08:32.664
COUNTRY FASTER THAN ANY PLAGUE.

00:08:32.698 --> 00:08:34.255
BUT KEEP IN MIND, AS THIS

00:08:34.289 --> 00:08:35.937
INSANITY CONTINUES, THAT IT

00:08:35.938 --> 00:08:37.212
DOESN’T HAPPEN IN A VACUUM.

00:08:37.246 --> 00:08:37.991
EVERY ACTION PROVOKES A

00:08:38.026 --> 00:08:38.764
REACTION.

00:08:38.799 --> 00:08:40.145
THAT’S A PHYSICS.

00:08:40.146 --> 00:08:42.155
WE DON’T KNOW WHERE THIS IS

00:08:42.157 --> 00:08:44.241
GOING, WE DON’T WANT TO KNOW

00:08:44.242 --> 00:08:46.097
WHERE IT’S GOING.

